Z||000000||Haze_Performance||07-18-2001||01:58 AM||||My first post being a Tri-Fiero owner....  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>Well my Formula has a new home. I drove out to LAMBO's (fellow Forum member) home in Iowa and did the trade. I am now the proud owner of a '84 Indy Pace Car & a Red '84 SE 4-speed (in addition to the '85 Sport Coupe I already have). The wife & I drove the 15 hour trip Saturday. I did have a little trouble with the Indy. The A/C belt was rubbing on the battery cable. It wore through and I believe it blew a fusible link. I have battery power but no ignition power. I had to tow it to my winter storage. I ordered the '84 Factory Service Manual from The Fiero Store. I'm going to fix it this week.  The '84 SE made it home with no problems. <P>Thanks Lambo..... It was great meeting you & the wife. I know you guys hated to see the Indy go, but I promise to give her a good home. ( I miss the Formula already  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> )  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>Also...... Thank You 007Doug for the offer.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif"> <BR>     </A><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>Click above to visit my website.</B></FONT></FONT>||||reg||10
Z||000001||Oreif||07-18-2001||02:23 AM||||Can't wait to see them!<BR>You know, like I said before, You can store the Indy over here. Just leave the keys and the title.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>So when are we going to install the stereo system in the 84 SE?<BR>I've got some cool idea's that I want to try in an 84/85 that has the seat speakers.<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">     <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 07-18-2001).]||||reg||14
