Z||000003||LAMBO||07-18-2001||08:58 AM||||Haze, I just hope you enjoy both of those cars as much as I did, especially the Indy. <P>I took the maiden voyage in the Formula Hybrid Monday. No problems and lots of compliments. Everyone wanted to know what it was. That was kinda cool. I'm going to order a 3.4 stroker short block for her this week from ARI. That should give it a little more spunk. Won't hurt to have a fresh bottom end in her either. Charged the AC last night. Has a short in the wiring somewhere though. Just hoping its a bad ground wire, easier to fix. It'll get fixed tonight. <P>I am now a believer in the claims of all the '88 owners when they say the car is a better ride than previous years and much more refined. I still love all Fieros, but now prefer driving an '88. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Todd||||reg||7
